id:                     E469
trigger_tool: conan
phase: test-package-build
error_signature: "no member named 'bind_port' in 'httplib::Server'"
severity: 2
category: header-only-library-server-port-binding
match_keywords: cpp-httplib, httplib, bind_port, bind_to_any_port, bind_to_port, Server, test_package, port binding
title: cpp-httplib test_package 中 bind_port() 不存在，需用 bind_to_any_port() 获取已绑定端口
root_cause: cpp-httplib 0.18.0 的 httplib::Server 没有 bind_port() 成员；可用 API 是 bind_to_port(host, port) 返回 bool、bind_to_any_port(host) 返回自动分配的端口号 int、listen_after_bind()/listen(host, port) 启动监听。编写本地 HTTP 往返测试时若按"绑定到自动端口 + 读取端口"的思路使用 bind_port() 会编译失败
affected_scope: 所有用 cpp-httplib 0.18.0 httplib::Server 绑定任意端口并需要读取端口号的消费者测试/示例代码
verification_cmd: "conan create . -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: use-bind-to-any-port
rec_description: test_package 中本地起 httplib::Server 时使用 bind_to_any_port(host) 获得自动分配端口，用该端口构造 Client 完成 HTTP 往返断言，替代不存在的 bind_port()
rec_command: conan create archives/c/cpp-httplib/0.18.0
rec_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: "bind_port()"
forbid_1_reason: cpp-httplib 0.18.0 httplib::Server 不存在该成员，直接编译失败
forbid_1_consequence: test_package 编译失败阻塞 conan create
similar_to: []
causes: []
caused_by: []
conflicts_with: []
prerequisite_of: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-cpp-httplib-0.18.0-bind-to-any-port.md
last_updated: 2026-08-30
source_event: cpp-httplib 0.18.0 R01 首轮适配 test_package 首编译失败，改 bind_to_any_port() 后 OHOS aarch64 conan create 与消费者测试通过
